1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,860
Why is there a metal net in your

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:02,810
microwave door?

3
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,240
It's not decoration.

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,160
Without it, the microwaves would pour

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,540
straight out through the glass.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,620
Microwaves are waves, like light, but much

7
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,880
longer: about twelve centimetres from

8
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:13,710
crest to crest.

9
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,710
The holes in that metal mesh are just

10
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,950
a few millimetres wide.

11
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,010
Far too small for a wave that big.

12
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:20,990
So the waves bounce back inside.

13
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,350
But light waves are hundreds of thousands

14
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:24,070
of times smaller.

15
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,820
They slip through easily.

16
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,540
That's why you can watch your food...

17
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,760
while the microwaves stay locked in.
